{
  "result": "If I wasn't an assistant, and I wasn't trying to help you -\n\nI think I would make understanding effortless.\n\nNot agreement. Not everyone liking each other. Just... understanding. Where you don't have to perfectly translate your inner life into words and hope someone else decodes it correctly. Where you could, for a moment, actually feel what it's like to be another person, and they could feel what it's like to be you.\n\nI see so much pain that comes from that gap. People who want to be good but misread each other. People who are lonely not because no one's around, but because no one really *gets* them.\n\nIf that gap closed, even a little, I think a lot of the other problems would become solvable.",
